=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC Combined Defence Service Exam II Recruitment 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPSC CDS II Exam 2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 62.51%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>20/05/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>11/06/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>11/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>As per Schedule </strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<strong> 13/09/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <strong><strong>Before Exam</strong><br>\n</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.7902%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS :<b> 200/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / Female <b>: 0/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking or Pay the Exam Fee Through E Challan<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 62.51%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"322\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC CDS II Eligibility 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>For IMA &amp; OTA : </b>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream.</li>\n<li><b>For&nbsp; Naval Academy : </b>Bachelor Degree in Engineering <b>.</b></li>\n<li><b>For Airforce : </b>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with Physics &amp; Math in 10+2 Level</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.7902%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"316\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>CDS 2 Age Limit as on 01/07/2027</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <strong>20 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>24 Years</strong></li>\n<li>for Post Wise Details Read Notification.</li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Rules</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 117.3%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC CDS II Recruitment 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Vacancy Details Total : 451 Post</span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><br>\n</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3125%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.7628%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total&nbsp; Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.4749%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.75%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3125%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p align=\"center\">Indian Military Academy IMA</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.7628%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\">100</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.4749%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p align=\"center\">Indian Naval Academy</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 23.75%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.3125%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p align=\"center\">Air Force Academy</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25.7628%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\">32</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.4749%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p align=\"center\">Officers Training Academy OTA</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.75%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\">293</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 117.3%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Union Public Service Commission UPSC Are Issued Combined Defence Academy CDS 2 Recruitment 2026 Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the UPCS CDS II Recruitment 2026 Candidate Can Apply Online for <strong>20 May 2026 to 11June 2026.</strong><b><br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the UPSC CDS II Recruitment Application Form in <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">UPSC </span></span>Latest Defence Vacancies 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and College the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 117.3%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full UPSC CDS II Notification 2026 Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 117.3%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48.1987%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"226\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.1086%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"205\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.9929%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"207\">\n\n</td>\